{"synopsis":"Lihat ini—!!\n\n[Menyelamatkan Dunia di Gym!]\n\nTahun 20XX. Dengan invasi monster yang tampak seperti keluar dari film B kelas, umat manusia membuka mata terhadap kekuatan baru!\n\nDi antara para pahlawan yang memancarkan kekuatan tanpa perlu latihan keras, ada seorang “harimau” yang menjaga Stronger Gym...\n\nBukan, itu bukan harimau sungguhan, tapi seorang pria yang mengenakan kaos dan celana bermotif harimau!\n\nHari ini, seperti biasa, dia menyambut para \"bayi gym\"-nya dengan sukacita.\n\n\"Apa? Bayi gym?! Jangan takut. Masuk saja!\"\n\nAyo saksikan sang tokoh utama dan teman-temannya di Stronger Gym membentuk jiwa dan raga yang sehat!","alternative_title":"100만 운동 유튜버인 내가 이 웹툰에서는 초능력도 없는 쩌리?","author":"John Stone","artist":"Giga Dead","chapters":[{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"ch_14","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"ch_13","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"ch_12","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"11","chapter":"11","slug":"ch_11","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"b152574d-8049-4138-9f2c-9f61af6d6ccf","number":"10","chapter":"10","title":"","date":"2025-05-23","released":"2025-05-23"},{"chapter_id":"ca429b33-0f97-474f-9e7c-9fd6b73b35ae","number":"9","chapter":"9","title":"","date":"2025-05-16","released":"2025-05-16"},{"chapter_id":"054a67e6-24f5-4119-89fa-e4fedee6c0ee","number":"8","chapter":"8","title":"","date":"2025-05-09","released":"2025-05-09"},{"chapter_id":"9b0783ed-613c-46ba-8633-406f3a90410d","number":"7","chapter":"7","title":"","date":"2025-05-03","released":"2025-05-03"},{"chapter_id":"ac75b696-1c80-4a8e-b755-18bb10356bdb","number":"6","chapter":"6","title":"","date":"2025-05-03","released":"2025-05-03"},{"chapter_id":"85c02